 "sentences": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.78,
   "n_words": 6,
   "text": "They painted the jail cell pink."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.1,
   "end": 3.24,
   "n_words": 5,
   "text": "And not just any pink."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.38,
   "end": 10.94,
   "n_words": 29,
   "text": "A scientist mixes exactly one pint of red into a gallon of white and makes the guards repaint the whole thing because the first coat was the wrong shade."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.22,
   "end": 12.4,
   "n_words": 4,
   "text": "The guards are thrilled."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.92,
   "end": 14.2,
   "n_words": 6,
   "text": "Barbie's gonna love it in here."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.42,
   "end": 16.42,
   "n_words": 7,
   "text": "Then he gives them one strange rule."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.6,
   "end": 22.04,
   "n_words": 20,
   "text": "Every prisoner who goes in comes out after exactly 15 minutes and he waits at the door with a stopwatch."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.3,
   "end": 25.14,
   "n_words": 14,
   "text": "So the first guy they throw in is the biggest inmate in the building."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.14,
   "end": 28.22,
   "n_words": 8,
   "text": "300 pounds of tattoos, laughing at the walls."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.58,
   "end": 33.36,
   "n_words": 20,
   "text": "But when they pull him out 15 minutes later, the scientist asks the skinniest guard there to arm wrestle him."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.44,
   "end": 35.88,
   "n_words": 10,
   "text": "And the guard slams his hand down in two seconds."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.18,
   "end": 36.68,
   "n_words": 2,
   "text": "Wait, what?"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.98,
   "end": 38.52,
   "n_words": 5,
   "text": "Well, nobody can explain it."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.62,
   "end": 42.66,
   "n_words": 16,
   "text": "But within a year, jails all over the country are painting their cells by the truckload."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.78,
   "end": 45.76,
   "n_words": 13,
   "text": "Until one night, a guard forgets about the guy in the pink cell."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.92,
   "end": 47.58,
   "n_words": 6,
   "text": "At 15 minutes, he's sitting quietly."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.88,
   "end": 49.0,
   "n_words": 4,
   "text": "At 20, he's pacing."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.26,
   "end": 52.54,
   "n_words": 18,
   "text": "And by the time they open the door, he's trying to rip the bench out of the floor."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.78,
   "end": 57.16,
   "n_words": 16,
   "text": "You see, the scientist swore this pink drained the fight out of anyone in 15 minutes."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.46,
   "end": 59.82,
   "n_words": 10,
   "text": "So jails used it to calm their most violent prisoners."
  },
  {
   "start": 60.18,
   "end": 62.26,
   "n_words": 7,
   "text": "But it only works for 15 minutes."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.48,
   "end": 65.0,
   "n_words": 11,
   "text": "Leave someone in any longer and it does the exact opposite."
  }
 ]
